Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 12:25:04 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] feat(theme): add Eprisi L0 color/font token overrides

- Self-host IBM Plex Sans (body) and Plus Jakarta Sans (heading) as
  latin-subset woff2, no external font CDN calls at runtime
- Override --rcx-color-surface/font/stroke-* with values sampled from
  mockups/rocketchat/{login,dashboard}.jpg
- Import both after fuselage.css in main.css so overrides win by
  source order, no !important
